WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,750 --> 00:00:03,350
There is no need to say this anymore, Mina

2
00:00:03,550 --> 00:00:07,350
I'm afraid Mr. Su knew I was in the car from the beginning

3
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:11,700
I'm just curious, how do you know my identity?

4
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:14,100
An old man lost a game of chess to me

5
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:15,700
Answered my question

6
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:19,650
It turns out to be the old but immortal thing

7
00:00:19,650 --> 00:00:23,050
So when Mina mentioned that the hotel owner wanted to buy land with me,

8
00:00:23,250 --> 00:00:24,650
I suddenly realized

9
00:00:24,650 --> 00:00:27,250
After all, that land is yours to begin with, right?

10
00:00:27,450 --> 00:00:30,770
The residual beauty, Wang Yishuang, Miss Hong Yan

11
00:00:32,260 --> 00:00:34,860
Yes, I need money to recover from my injury

12
00:00:34,860 --> 00:00:36,860
As long as he returns to the ghost king level strength

13
00:00:36,860 --> 00:00:40,460
The traitors from the three major gangs may die secretly one by one.

14
00:00:40,460 --> 00:00:42,660
But if your land is bought at a low price

15
00:00:42,660 --> 00:00:44,460
It means you are seriously injured

16
00:00:44,460 --> 00:00:47,980
At that time, I am afraid that the three major gangs will immediately counterattack

17
00:00:47,980 --> 00:00:49,180
Kill you and seize power

18
00:00:49,180 --> 00:00:51,780
So, Mr. Su, are you willing to help me?
